Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:10:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] HALL-1: hall_1 flag (OFF) layers a candidate over the
 shipped Crossing Hall config

One flag-off section in crossing_hall.json; crossing_hall.gd apply_hall_1 deep-merges
its overrides, appends list rows and removes rows by name before the Hall is built.
OFF leaves every section as shipped (test_crossing_hall_hall_1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
